  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8105.03 Allocation of Plumbing and Mechanical Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8105.03 Allocation of Plumbing and Mechanical Fees. Any permit and re-inspection fees pertaining to plumbing and mechanical permits issued under these rules and collected by the state fire marshal shall be deposited into the general fund pursuant to RSA 153:28, II.\n\nSource. #12022, eff 10-26-16\n\nAPPENDIX",
